--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Deployment credentials
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No credentials are included in this distribution. The deployment script reads
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID and PASSWORD from the environment
(or from a local .env that is excluded by .gitignore). Rotating any credential
that was ever committed to a remote is the responsibility of the operator.
